> Giants and spinach will give you up to 10 points of strength until
> 18/90 (further on only 1 point), so those are the primary source of
> intrinsic strength. Royal jelly (from bee hives) gives you 1 point
> as do blessed potions of gain ability, so these two sources are good
> to save until once you reached the 18/90 (but still interesting to
> eat them before if you manage to pass beyond some internal limit
