At levels where giants start to become common, I like to retreat to a
prior level and wander around until I am no longer satiated then
descend and kill another giant.  Having a tinning kit makes that
cycle much quicker.  Another trick is to cast as many spells as
possible to burn through nutrition - A valkyrie can teleport like crazy
within a level and be able to eat a giant's corpse soon.



